24. Index Functions

| Method          | Use                      | Example                |
| --------------- | ------------------------ | ---------------------- |
| `set_index()`   | Set a column as index    | `df.set_index("ID")`   |
| `reset_index()` | Reset index              | `df.reset_index()`     |
| `reindex()`     | Change/reorder index     | `df.reindex(...)`      |
| `rename_axis()` | Rename index/column axis | `df.rename_axis("ID")` |
